{"c":[{"id":"e08d1ae5c480f911","sum":"A18: Cotypist on Sam's Mac takes plain Tab one word at a time (debug state lists otherTabOwners); mid-line ghost text is mostly silenced by KeyType's lowConfidenceMidLine, and SuffixFit scores only the first token after the caret (floor -7.0 nats).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T183212Z-37e231b8935fe92e","text":"Cotypist runs on Sam's Mac with its accept-partial shortcut on plain Tab (one word per press): Q1's one-word Tabs were Cotypist's, Caret's tap.consumed/offers.claimed truly 0; debug state lists otherTabOwners (A18).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T183212Z-d8342f2456ba377e","text":"Ghost text between words: KeyType's lowConfidenceMidLine silences most mid-line candidates in Caret --probe-replay; A18's SuffixFit scores only the first token after the caret (floor -7.0 nats, dev-run-3), since tokens 2-3 were near 0 for every candidate.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"88019d610c5e4bca","sum":"I3: Fixtures/memory.ndjson is the helper's golden byte for byte (wrote line is host-memory-9); tests find lines by id; the host refuses the paste route when the clipboard holds a type it cannot restore (file URL, private types), writing by AX instead.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T195224Z-8ef6ab64ee3f2dea","text":"I3: apps/caret Fixtures/memory.ndjson is the helper's golden byte for byte as of H1 (host-memory-5 request added, A16's wrote line is host-memory-9, no -8); tests find lines by id, never by index.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T195224Z-99ff86984f364892","text":"I3: host refuses the paste route when the prior clipboard holds a type outside ReconcilingClipboard.restorableTypes (file URL, private types): AX write instead, else fail clipboardUnrestorable. A17's VM probe lost a file-url item 5/5 while restore said restored.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
